.TH SYNC 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sync \- requests writeback of filesystem data and metadata
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B void sync(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Requests writeback of filesystem data and metadata. Linux provides no error result for this syscall.
.SH RETURN VALUE
No value is returned.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sync (2)
